+### Defect detail — `/projects/{project}/defects/{defectId}`
+One defect's page (2026-09-07). Facts (supplier + contact, sent, raised,
+resolved), Edit modal (location, supplier, contact email, description), status
+dropdown. **"Send to supplier"** (primary, until the first send) opens the
+shared composer pre-addressed to the supplier's directory email and pre-written
+from the defect — edit, then Send from the projects mailbox; the sent copy
+carries JPMS/DEF-#### so the supplier's replies file themselves back into
+Communications, and the server stamps Sent and moves Open → In progress. After
+that the button reads **"Chase supplier"**. Communications = the shared thread
+list with Find & tag emails, Reply/Forward, New email. **To-dos** panel = the
+to-dos ABOUT this defect (an explicit link on the to-do); "New to-do" raises
+one on the project with the title and link pre-filled; the to-do's page shows
+"About: DEF-####" linking back. Connector: list_defects / find_by_reference
+route here; list_todos aboutRecordId; add_todo aboutRecordType Defect. No
+connector action sends the defect — that is done on this page.
 
